{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01C57EjeWTrJNRS22Htfp22g", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.nasa.gov/history/astronaut-armstrong-survives-llrv-crash/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://migflug.com/afterburner/neil-armstrong-llrv-flying-bedstead-ejection-1968/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.Wikipedia.org/wiki/LLTV\"}, {\"url\": \"https://airandspace.si.edu/stories/editorial/neil-armstrongs-apollo-11-close-call\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.flyingmag.com/pilots-places-pilots-adventures-more-video-crash-could-have-killed-neil-armstrong/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://migflug.com/afterburner/?p=8159553\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.nasa.gov/feature/55-years-ago-astronaut-armstrong-survives-llrv-crash/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://historynet.com/?p=13744299\"}, {\"url\": \"https://amuedge.com/this-week-in-space-history-1968-neil-armstrong-survives-training-crash/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://amuedge.com/?p=29729\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:16:11.520Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Neil Armstrong LLRV crash eject date 1968", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_011RnDCFyWyjkCLgUfycPuJq", "content": [{"title": "Suggested Searches", "url": "https://www.nasa.gov/history/astronaut-armstrong-survives-llrv-crash/"}, {"title": "The Flying Bedstead That Nearly Killed Armstrong", "url": "https://migflug.com/afterburner/neil-armstrong-llrv-flying-bedstead-ejection-1968/"}, {"title": "Lunar Landing Research Vehicle", "url": "https://www.Wikipedia.org/wiki/LLTV"}, {"title": "Jul 19, 2019", "url": "https://airandspace.si.edu/stories/editorial/neil-armstrongs-apollo-11-close-call"}, {"title": "pilots places pilots adventures more video crash could have killed neil armstrong", "url": "https://www.flyingmag.com/pilots-places-pilots-adventures-more-video-crash-could-have-killed-neil-armstrong/"}, {"title": "The Flying Bedstead That Nearly Killed Armstrong", "url": "https://migflug.com/afterburner/?p=8159553"}, {"title": "Suggested Searches", "url": "https://www.nasa.gov/feature/55-years-ago-astronaut-armstrong-survives-llrv-crash/"}, {"title": "Share This Article", "url": "https://historynet.com/?p=13744299"}, {"title": "AMU Editor's Pick Original Space", "url": "https://amuedge.com/this-week-in-space-history-1968-neil-armstrong-survives-training-crash/"}, {"title": "By Wes O’Donnell", "url": "https://amuedge.com/?p=29729"}]}, "The crash happened on **May 6, 1968**, at Ellington Air Force Base in Houston. NASA reports that Armstrong took off on a simulated lunar landing mission in a Lunar Landing Research Vehicle (LLRV). The craft then lost control, and about 200 feet above the ground, Armstrong chose to eject. While the LLRV crashed and burned on impact, Armstrong parachuted safely to the ground and suffered no injuries.\n\nSources differ on the cause. NASA's accident summary says a loss of helium pressure caused depletion of the hydrogen peroxide used for the reserve attitude thrusters. Wikipedia instead says the investigation found that the fuel for the vehicle's attitude control thrusters had run out and that high winds were a major factor.\n\nTiming details also vary slightly. One account puts the ejection less than a second before the LLRV crashed in a fireball, while Wikipedia says he had about four seconds on his full parachute before landing on the ground unhurt. Flights resumed later that year, and engineers corrected the problems before flights resumed in October, using an updated version of the craft called the Lunar Landing Training Vehicle (LLTV)."], "durationSeconds": 5.382760124999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01C57EjeWTrJNRS22Htfp22g", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDYxzoufyTCFMd94Aody", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：1968 年 5 月 6 日**，地点是休斯敦的埃灵顿空军基地（Ellington Air Force Base）。当时阿姆斯特朗驾驶的 LLRV-1 在模拟登月时失控。他在离地约 200 英尺（约 60 米）的高度弹射，跳伞落地，没有受伤。飞行器坠地起火烧毁。\n\n搜索 1 次。\n\n来源：\n- [NASA：Astronaut Armstrong Survives LLRV Crash](https://www.nasa.gov/history/astronaut-armstrong-survives-llrv-crash/)\n- [NASA：55 Years Ago, Astronaut Armstrong Survives LLRV Crash](https://www.nasa.gov/feature/55-years-ago-astronaut-armstrong-survives-llrv-crash/)\n- [Smithsonian 航空航天博物馆：Neil Armstrong's Apollo 11 Close Call](https://airandspace.si.edu/stories/editorial/neil-armstrongs-apollo-11-close-call)\n- [AMU Edge：This Week in Space History – 1968](https://amuedge.com/this-week-in-space-history-1968-neil-armstrong-survives-training-crash/)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1177, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4310, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1177}, "output_tokens": 430, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:16:16.409Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDYxzYGt3eEpMhkufoV9"}
